    "title": "Glass Duster Cloth Set for Kitchen and Window Cleaning, 3 Pc",
    "body_html": "<h4 style=\"font-size:14px; font-weight:700; margin:0 0 10px;\">Glass Cleaning Duster Cloth Set with Soft Terry Weave, Textured Loops and Reinforced Edges for Everyday Kitchen and Household Glass Wiping</h4><p style=\"font-weight:700; margin:0 0 6px;\">Description :-</p><p>Keep everyday glass and kitchen wiping tasks organised with this glass cleaning duster cloth set. The soft terry weave features textured loops, a woven reverse and reinforced edges for practical household use. Fold a cloth for comfortable handling when wiping accessible glass panels, kitchen counters or suitable tabletops. The absorbent, washable and reusable fabric makes the three-piece set a useful addition to routine home cleaning supplies.</p><p style=\"font-weight:700; margin:10px 0 6px;\">Key Features :-</p><ul>\n<li>Soft terry weave provides a flexible cloth for everyday glass and kitchen wiping.</li>\n<li>Textured loops give the wiping side a towel-like surface for routine cleaning.</li>\n<li>Absorbent fabric helps handle everyday splashes on suitable household surfaces.</li>\n<li>Reinforced edges provide a finished border for repeated handling.</li>\n<li>Washable and reusable construction allows the cloths to be cleaned between tasks.</li>\n<li>Three separate cloths help organise glass and kitchen cleaning routines.</li>\n<li>Flexible rectangular cloths fold comfortably in the hand during wiping.</li>\n<li>Striped and floral detailing gives the cloths a distinctive patterned finish.</li>\n</ul><p style=\"font-weight:700; margin:10px 0 6px;\">Ideal For :-</p><ul>\n<li>Wiping household glass cabinet panels.</li>\n<li>Cleaning accessible window glass.</li>\n<li>Routine kitchen countertop wiping.</li>\n<li>Wiping suitable glass tabletops.</li>\n<li>Everyday kitchen surface cleaning.</li>\n<li>Keeping separate cloths for different household tasks.</li>\n</ul><p style=\"font-weight:700; margin:10px 0 6px;\">Specifications :-</p><ul>\n<li>Product Type: Glass Cleaning Duster Cloth Set</li>\n<li>Material: Terry-Weave Fabric</li>\n<li>Shape: Rectangular</li>\n<li>Surface: Textured Loops with Woven Reverse</li>\n<li>Edge Finish: Reinforced Edges</li>\n<li>Package Contents: 3 x Glass Cleaning Duster Cloths</li>\n</ul>",
